{"id":"n85119-1-12","stage":2,"title":"행운 · 幸运","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85119-1-12-1","ko":"좋아하는 숫자가 뭐예요?","zh":"你喜欢的数字是什么呀？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"좋아하는","meaning":"喜欢，喜爱","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢，喜爱；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"2","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"숫자가","meaning":"数字","explanation":"숫자：数字；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"숫자","audio":"/audio/dd5886210ef2c0d17c77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65425","senseId":"1","lemma":"숫자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐예요?","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；예요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢，喜爱","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"希望享受着做。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]},{"id":"dd5886210ef2c0d1","term":"숫자","zh":"数字","audio":"/audio/dd5886210ef2c0d17c77.mp3","entryId":"65425","definition":"表示数的文字。","pronunciation":["수ː짜","숟ː짜"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]}],"audio":"/audio/5409737475c6e964c124.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85119-1-12-2","ko":"저는 행운의 숫자인 칠을 좋아해요.","zh":"我喜欢代表好运的数字7。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"행운의","meaning":"幸运","explanation":"행운：幸运；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"행운","audio":"/audio/5cbd51fcb97df0875cbb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85119","senseId":"1","lemma":"행운","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"숫자인","meaning":"数字","explanation":"숫자：数字；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"숫자","audio":"/audio/dd5886210ef2c0d17c77.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65425","senseId":"1","lemma":"숫자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"칠을","meaning":"七","explanation":"칠：七；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"칠","audio":"/audio/e8eb2f9b25b9fd2fe1b1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71470","senseId":"1","lemma":"칠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아해요.","meaning":"喜欢，喜爱","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢，喜爱；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"2","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"5cbd51fcb97df087","term":"행운","zh":"幸运","audio":"/audio/5cbd51fcb97df0875cbb.mp3","entryId":"85119","definition":"好运气；或指幸福的运势。","pronunciation":["행ː운"]},{"id":"dd5886210ef2c0d1","term":"숫자","zh":"数字","audio":"/audio/dd5886210ef2c0d17c77.mp3","entryId":"65425","definition":"表示数的文字。","pronunciation":["수ː짜","숟ː짜"]},{"id":"e8eb2f9b25b9fd2f","term":"칠","zh":"七","audio":"/audio/e8eb2f9b25b9fd2fe1b1.mp3","entryId":"71470","definition":"六加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["칠"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢，喜爱","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"希望享受着做。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/de483e0d7456d0ff24e7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.897,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85119","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":67,"sequenceScore":1.7237,"ques